  "summary": null,
  "thumbnail_url": null,
  "body": "<p>To enable (or disable) <strong>Push-to-talk</strong> activation beeping, just open your <strong>User Settings</strong> by clicking on the cog icon in the bottom left corner:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360016012051/PTT_1.jpg\" alt=\"PTT_1.jpg\" width=\"801\" height=\"215\"><br><br></p>\n<p>Open the <strong>Notifications</strong> tab (in the left side bar), and scroll down to select/deselect \"<strong>PTT Activate</strong>\" and \"<strong>PTT Deactivate</strong>\" to adjust which noises you do or don't want to hear.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058277091/Capture59.jpg\" alt=\"Capture59.jpg\"></p>",
